rs.\n\n## Missing literatures\n- Cross-benchmark score prediction and matrix completion on LLM evaluation matrices\n- Adaptive or IRT-based test and benchmark selection for LLM evaluation\n- Open LLM Leaderboard and its component benchmarks\n- Empirical evidence of benchmark redundancy\n\n## Deliberately not flagged\n- Rank-Gauss transform and kNN: standard components, and the draft already states them as such.\n- Numeric results and protocol facts: grounded in evidence files.\n- Limitations and discussion text: deliberately self-critical, with no external claims that need support.\nEOF"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2418,"cache_read_input_tokens":39445,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2418},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8e1be07f-12b0-4a35-9573-dafb876efa2b","uuid":"613e7adc-7aa3-4cdb-805f-499d0a4551c2","timestamp":"2026-11-11T12:42:56.812Z","request_id":"req_011CgwACcPtseXvKdkuCm2Az"}
